	function WriteSkill35100(){ return DrawSkill("Sacred Territory","aot_miracle","PvP:0.7/Soft:100/Medium:100/Metal:100",1.6,0.866,30,150,"Meet the Item Dealer in Reboldoeux. Youll find her on Market Street.","Lv.1: \u003Cbr\u003EGreat! I think you are ready to continue your journey. Take some more supplies - they always come in handy!\u003Cbr\u003ELv.10:Youve come a long way already. Keep following instructions of Nunez and visit the City of Auch.<br>Return to me once youve completed some of Eleonores quests in Auch.\u003Cbr\u003ELv.11:Youre growing stronger every time we meet!<br>I think its time for a wardrobe upgrade - a pioneer should always look sharp.\u003Cbr\u003ELv.12:Take this coupon. You can exchange it for any costume you like at the Costume Trader.","My character 8m away.","[(Event)Drop Manual] Increases chance to acquire item by 20%.","500 SP;Ancient Star orb x20;");
	};
	function WriteSkill35101(){ return DrawSkill("Sacred Territory","aot_caenopy","PvP:0.7/Soft:100/Medium:100/Metal:100",1.033,0.866,10,0,"You should seek out and defeat some of these bosses.<br>Check your quest journal for details.<br>Defeat all bosses from the list and come back to me.","Lv.1: \u003Cbr\u003EBring a complete set of Area Vouchers to any Tombstone to receive a random reward.<br>Im sure luck will be on your side!\u003Cbr\u003ELv.10:For example, you may find Enhance Boosters in the chest.<br>These will help you safely enhance your items. Here, take a few.\u003Cbr\u003ELv.11:Now that weve covered dungeon profits, lets step outside and see what other ways there are to get valuable items.\u003Cbr\u003ELv.12:In the Cathari Falls, Jezebel Glen, and El Lago de Tres Hermanas, youll find Ferruccio Forges.<br>Every 30 minutes, one family can use a forge to craft an item.","1 Appointed Character","[2] Faction members can have contribution basically. [Win : +4000 / Lose : +2000]","500 SP;Ancient Star orb x10;");
	};
	function WriteSkill35102(){ return DrawSkill("Sacred Territory","aot_siaringbooster","PvP:0.7/Soft:100/Medium:100/Metal:100",1.033,0.866,10,0,"Sometimes, she gives out a special key as a reward.<br>This key will help you obtain new equipment.<br>Here, I have one left for you.","Lv.1: \u003Cbr\u003EI won these coupons by participating in mini-games on Bahia Island.<br>You should try it too! Lets send you on a little beach vacation.\u003Cbr\u003ELv.10:Lets keep making your family stronger.<br>Now that youve learned how to earn vis, lets talk about improving your gear.\u003Cbr\u003ELv.11:Start by acquiring level 84 elite equipment.<br>You can buy it from other players or get it by defeating high-level zone bosses.<br>But dont forget - gear also needs to be enhanced and enchanted.\u003Cbr\u003ELv.12:You can get Enchant Chips by completing punitive forces missions.<br>I want you to try getting some. Im sure youve been to Prison de Joaquin - lets start there.","1 Appointed Character","[3] Ones who dont have Faction cannot get contribution.","500 SP;Ancient Star orb x10;");
	};
