	function WriteSkill38701(){ return DrawSkill("Now, lets practice swapping out your gear.","berserknessgs","PvP:0.7/Soft:100/Medium:100/Metal:100",1.533,0,30,0,"First, select the character whose equipment you wish to change. Just click on their portrait at the bottom of your screen.","Lv.1: \u003Cbr\u003EThe Zone Map highlights all notable figures in your current zone, as well as paths leading to adjacent regions.\u003Cbr\u003ELv.10:Perhaps we can strike up a mutually beneficial arrangement.<br>You see, I was transporting a modest shipment of rum to the New World. I managed to salvage almost every single scattered bottle from the shore... save for one.\u003Cbr\u003ELv.11:\u003Cspan style=\u0022color:#F8D752\u0022\u003ETo purchase goods, navigate to the Purchase tab. The merchants available wares will be displayed in this window.\u003C/span\u003E","Self-buff","[memorize] Decrease cast time significantly.","340 SP;Ancient Star orb x10;");
	};
	function WriteSkill38702(){ return DrawSkill("Next, open your inventory. Every item you acquire is safely stored in your shared Family Inventory.<br>Press [Alt + E] or click the bag icon in the top menu to open it.","arcdowngs","PvP:0.7/Soft:80/Medium:100/Metal:130",2.2,0,0,58,"Opening the Family Inventory will also bring up the Equipment menu for your selected character.<br>Here, you can review their detailed attributes and current gear.","Lv.1: ATK: 370%\u003Cbr\u003EIf a character cannot use a certain item, its icon in your inventory will appear grayed out.","Hover your cursor over an item to inspect its detailed stats, enchantments, and enhancement level.","[Armor Crasher] DEF decreases by 50% for 20 secs.","550 SP;");
	};
	function WriteSkill38703(){ return DrawSkill("Equip the armor piece you just earned from the previous task, then speak with me again to proceed.<br>\u003Cspan style=\u0022color:#F8D752\u0022\u003ESelect a matching character, equip the rewarded item, and speak to Jack Space to continue your training.\u003C/span\u003E","dragonabashgs","PvP:0.7/Soft:90/Medium:100/Metal:120",4.033,1.533,14,98,"Equip the item provided by Jack and speak with him again.","Lv.1: ATK: 485%\u003Cbr\u003EOutstanding! Youre a natural. Please, accept these potions as your reward.","Speak with Jack Space to learn more about equipping gear.","[Drain] Proportionate to the maximum constituition, HP has continuously dropped and item usage not allowed.","800 SP;");
	};
	function WriteSkill38704(){ return DrawSkill("Potions will keep you standing and casting in the heat of a tough battle.<br>You can find them under the Expend tab in your inventory.","flyandcrushgs","PvP:0.7/Soft:75/Medium:100/Metal:130",2.2,0,18,74,"A Health Potion restores the HP of your selected character when consumed.<br>Should a characters HP drop to zero, they will fall in battle.<br>Always keep an eye on those health bars!<br>Note that while in Keep Mode, a Scout will automatically tend to your wounds, so save your potions for dire emergencies.","Lv.1: ATK: 685%\u003Cbr\u003EUse any potion now, then speak with me again to advance your training.","A Soul Potion restores your selected characters SP.<br>Casting powerful skills drains your SP reserves.<br>While it naturally recovers over time, a swift draft from a potion will get you back in action instantly when a fight gets chaotic.","[Armor Brake] DEF decreases.","720 SP;");
	};
	function WriteSkill38705(){ return DrawSkill("Consume either a Health Potion or a Soul Potion.","addestructiongs","PvP:0.7/Soft:60/Medium:100/Metal:140",3.7,0,27,145,"Learn how to use potions by following Jack Spaces instructions.","Lv.1: ATK: 820%\u003Cbr\u003EI highly recommend charting your course to Coimbra using the Zone Map.<br>Press [Alt + Z] or click the compass icon on the top menu to display it.","Up to 5 enemies 6m away and within a 5m radius","","1040 SP;");
	};
